      "integrity": "sha512-RA1GjUVMnvYFxYeh aapki **`package-lock.json`** file ka hissa hai. **`package-lock.json` ko manually edit ya update nahi kiya jata**, kyunki is mein har package ke exact hash, sub-dependencies aur resolved URLs hote hain jo npm automatically generate karta hai.

Isko properly update karne ke liye aapko **`package.json`** update karni hogi aur npm command chalani hogi.

---

### Step 1: Apni `package.json` ko update karein

Apni project directory mein `package.json` file kholein aur uske dependencies section ko update karein:

```json
{
  "name": "social_media_backend",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "",
  "main": "index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node index.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "axios": "^1.7.9",
    "cheerio": "^1.0.0",
    "cors": "^2.8.5",
    "dotenv": "^16.4.7",
    "express": "^4.21.2",
    "puppeteer": "^24.4.0",
    "yt-dlp-exec": "^3.0.16"
  }
}
